  "h1": "Angular Tree List - Filter Row",
  "descriptionEn": "The filter row allows users to enter a value for each column and filter grid data by those values. To display the filter row, set the filterRow.visible property to true. If you need to disable a filter row cell for a specific column, set the column's allowFiltering property to false. Depending on a column's dataType, its filter row cell contains different editors: dataType Editor \"string\", \"number\", \"object\" Text box \"boolean\" Drop-down list \"date\" Date picker \"datetime\" Date and time picker",
